2026-10-20T04:29:46.1848325Z PASS repo with .git DIR contributes each convention subdir it has
2026-10-20T04:29:46.1852837Z PASS a git WORKTREE (.git file) counts as a repo
2026-10-20T04:29:46.1853382Z PASS a directory WITHOUT .git is not a repo
2026-10-20T04:29:46.1854003Z PASS a repo without any listed subdir contributes nothing
2026-10-20T04:29:46.1854839Z PASS an excluded child NAME is skipped even when it is a repo
2026-10-20T04:29:46.1856395Z PASS a missing parent is skipped silently
2026-10-20T04:29:46.1856867Z PASS discovered roots are articles, and marked
2026-10-20T04:29:46.1878855Z PASS explicit + discovered are unioned
2026-10-20T04:29:46.1881965Z PASS a path in both appears once, keeping the explicit entry
2026-10-20T04:29:46.1886077Z PASS exclude is handed to the builder
2026-10-20T04:29:46.1888543Z PASS skipNames extends the built-in set, never replaces it
2026-10-20T04:29:46.1917720Z PASS no discover block = no discovery
2026-10-20T04:29:46.1919438Z PASS an existing sources.json is NOT rewritten with a discover block
2026-10-20T04:29:46.1930955Z PASS a malformed discover block degrades to defaults, never throws
2026-10-20T04:29:46.1947912Z PASS a freshly seeded sources.json carries the discover block
2026-10-20T04:29:46.1949103Z PASS seeding does not invent roots outside the literal list + wikis
2026-10-20T04:29:46.1965660Z PASS a discovered root CONTAINING an explicit root is dropped (explicit wins)
2026-10-20T04:29:46.1967065Z PASS an unrelated discovered root is untouched by that drop
2026-10-20T04:29:46.1993200Z PASS a discovered root INSIDE an explicit root is dropped too
2026-10-20T04:29:46.2018355Z PASS between two discovered roots the ANCESTOR is kept and the descendant dropped
2026-10-20T04:29:46.2020346Z PASS a shared PREFIX is not containment (…/repoF/doc does not swallow …/repoF/docs)
2026-10-20T04:29:46.2715278Z PASS a REAL build with an explicit root nested in a discovered one does not throw
2026-10-20T04:29:46.2716318Z PASS each file is indexed exactly once
2026-10-20T04:29:46.2742121Z PASS the explicit (nested) root is the one that survives
2026-10-20T04:29:46.2744007Z PASS the dropped ancestor's other files are NOT indexed (explicit scope wins, as before discovery)
2026-10-20T04:29:46.3418060Z PASS a discovered root is indexed
2026-10-20T04:29:46.3455014Z PASS its article is searchable
